{"unit_id": "tag:04NJ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>。芽（germs）的态射（morphisms）的性质\n<MATHSEG_0001>局部环（local ring）<MATHSEG_0002>（取于纤维（fibre））的维数（dimension）为<MATHSEG_0003>\n是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）源与目标上局部（local on the source-and-target）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "local on the source-and-target", "target_term": "源与目标上局部"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽", "context": "概形芽的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所给芽态射。"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "纤维在指定点的局部环。"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "芽态射的纤维。"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数", "context": "纤维局部环的维数。"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "局部性所用拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "local on the source-and-target", "target_term": "源与目标上局部", "context": "所定义性质的局部性。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04NJ:proof", "translation": "给定定义<REF_0001>中的一个图（diagram），我们得到纤维（fibres）的一个平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>，它将<MATH_0002>映到<MATH_0003>，见引理<REF_0002>。因此，结论由引理<REF_0003>得出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "局部性的定义图。"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "从定义图获得的纤维。"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "纤维态射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所获得的纤维态射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04NK:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>。芽（germs）的态射（morphisms）的性质\n<MATH_0002>\n是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）源与目标上局部（local on the source-and-target）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "local on the source-and-target", "target_term": "源与目标上局部"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽", "context": "概形芽的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所给芽态射。"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "局部性所用拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "local on the source-and-target", "target_term": "源与目标上局部", "context": "超越次数性质的局部性。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04NK:proof", "translation": "给定定义<REF_0001>中的一个图（diagram），我们得到如下局部环（local rings）的局部（local）同态（homomorphisms）的图（diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n注意，垂直箭头（vertical arrows）是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）环映射（ring maps）的局部化（localizations），特别地，它们是非分歧（unramified）的（见代数（Algebra），第<REF_0002>节）。因此<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>是有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extensions）。于是有\n<MATH_0004>\n这就证明了本引理。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "vertical arrows", "target_term": "垂直箭头"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "localizations", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "定义图及局部环图。"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "指定点的局部环。"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "同态的局部性。"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态", "context": "局部环之间的同态。"}, {"source_term": "vertical arrows", "target_term": "垂直箭头", "context": "局部环图中的垂直箭头。"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "被局部化环映射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "构成垂直箭头的环映射。"}, {"source_term": "localizations", "target_term": "局部化", "context": "垂直箭头的描述。"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "垂直箭头的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "tar